# Server-side secrets — also set these in Cloudflare Workers environment variables before deploying
# PMS edge function that would receive intake submissions and create client profiles.
# Bounce The Pound's Supabase project does not have this edge function yet — the
# primary submit path (src/lib/intake.functions.ts) writes directly to the
# `clients` / `intake_submissions` tables via the service key below and does not
# need these. They're only used by the curl-testable mirror route
# (src/routes/api/public/intake.ts); leave blank until that edge function exists.
PMS_EDGE_URL=
PMS_EDGE_KEY=

# Supabase service role key — from Bounce The Pound's Supabase dashboard → Settings → API → service_role
